ONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3. 첨부파일 활용하여 신청서 및 계획서, 학부(과)확인서 체출</span></p></span><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">♣첨부파일① 융합형 캡스톤 디자인 신청서 및 계획서</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">♣첨부파일② 융합형 캡스톤 디자인 학부(과) 확인서</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">♣첨부파일③ 융합형 캡스톤 디자인 지원예산 정산시 구비서류 및 유의사항 안내</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\">공 학 교 육 혁 신 센 터</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
